'''Awa-Odori Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Summer Break Cats#Summer Diary|Summer Diary]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] grants [[Behemoth Slayer]] and marginally improved stats.

