==Trivia==
*Awa-Odori Cat wears a traditional Obon dance costume, So-Ran Cat dons a Happi coat and headband, and Gorgeous Groovin' Cat sports a golden kimono.
*Normal Form references the [[wikipedia:Awa Dance Festival|Awa Dance Festival]].
*Soran is part of Yosakoi adapted culture. Yosakoi originally coming from Kochi pfc. in Japan, then adapted to Hokkaido style and more modern culture among the younger people. To differentiate with the original Yosakoi, it gets called Yosakoi-Soran. In short, Yosakoi Soran is more a modern-styled Yosakoi.
*True Form references Ken Matsudaira and his outfit in [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XazyhnymUQo| Matsuken Samba II].

